(c4) SAC[To the sacred feast let joy be joined;](dh!iv)RIS(h) so(hg)lém(h!iwj)ni(ivHG)is(h) (,) 
jun(h)cta(f) sint(g) gáu(g)di(f)a,(e) (;) 
Et[Praise shall](f) ex(g) prae(f!gh)cór(f)di(e)is[sound from our hearts;](d) (,) so(f)nent(d) prae(c)có(ef)ni(d)a:(d) (:) 
Re[Let the old things depart and all be made new,](h)cé(i)dant(ji) vé(g)te(h)ra,(g) (,) no(ih)va(i) sint(ji) ó(h)mni(g)a,(h) (;) 
